                        Available commands
    run                 Run a benchmark
    play                Play manual mode - interact with a domain as the agent
    view                View simulation results
    domain              Show domain documentation
    start               Start all servers
    intro               Show an overview of tau-bench and available commands
    check-data          Check if data directory is properly configured
    evaluate-trajs      Evaluate trajectories and update rewards
    review              Run LLM-based conversation review on simulation
